This tool reproduces parts of the Flipper Zero firmware API so that a FAP can be
built and run on a host computer.

- The declarations in include/ describe the firmware's public API.
- gui.c implements the firmware's stock GUI modules (applications/services/gui/
  modules/*.c). Its drawing geometry is copied from that source, which is
  licensed GPL-3.0-or-later by Flipper Devices Inc.

Because of the second point this repository is GPL-3.0-or-later. The firmware it
derives from is at https://github.com/flipperdevices/flipperzero-firmware

No firmware code is vendored here: gui.c is a reimplementation written against
the same layout constants, and the shim implements the API surface from scratch.
